---
source: crates/surveyor/src/app/cli_args.rs
expression: output
---
Determine the version from git tags and commits, and write it into `Cargo.toml`
and `Cargo.lock`.

Usage: surveyor version [--allow-dirty] [--dry-run]

Flags:
      --allow-dirty  Continue when the working tree has changes, and mark the
                     version as dirty.
      --dry-run      Log what would be written instead of writing manifests,
                     `Cargo.lock`, and GitHub Actions files.
  -h, --help         Print help
